        "content": "What function calculates the intrinsic per-share value of an equity security using a two-stage dividend discount model, discounting explicitly forecast dividends for the first two years at the required return derived from the risk-free rate, beta, and market risk premium via CAPM, then applying a constant long-term dividend growth rate from year three onward through a Gordon growth terminal value, with the result rounded to three decimal places?",
