      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    risk_free_rate = 0.03\n    beta = 1.1\n    market_risk_premium = 0.05\n    dividend_year_1 = 1.13\n    dividend_year_2 = 1.22\n    long_term_growth_rate = 0.05\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    cost_of_equity = risk_free_rate + beta * market_risk_premium\n    dividend_year_3 = dividend_year_2 * (1 + long_term_growth_rate)\n    terminal_value_year_2 = dividend_year_3 / (\n        cost_of_equity - long_term_growth_rate\n    )\n\n    intrinsic_value = (\n        dividend_year_1 / (1 + cost_of_equity)\n        + (dividend_year_2 + terminal_value_year_2)\n        / (1 + cost_of_equity) ** 2\n    )\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(intrinsic_value, 3)\n```",
